# Checkbox Interactions — 20 "Italian" chips in a wrapping row; toggling one animates its colours/padding, fades a checkmark in/out and reflows every chip with a springy LinearTransition layout animation.
# What this test covers: checking chips in different rows (reflow pushes later chips to new rows), unchecking,
# double-tapping the same chip so the checkmark's entering animation is interrupted by its exiting one, a rapid
# burst on the first column while the layout springs are mid-flight, checking the last chip, and unchecking back.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/checkbox-interactions"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait "text" "What are your favorite cuisines?" 5000
wait 600
# Check chips in a few rows.
press 62 195
wait 500
press 175 256
wait 500
press 288 316
wait 500
press 62 438
wait 800
# Uncheck the first one.
press 62 195
wait 800
# Toggle the same chip twice fast: checkmark enter interrupted by exit.
press 62 256
wait 80
press 62 256
wait 800
# Rapid burst down the first column while layout springs run.
press 62 195
press 62 256
press 62 316
press 62 377
press 62 438
press 62 498
press 62 559
wait 1500
# The same column again (unchecks most, reflow back).
press 62 195
wait 200
press 62 256
wait 200
press 62 316
wait 200
press 62 377
wait 200
press 62 438
wait 200
press 62 498
wait 200
press 62 559
wait 1500
# Repeated taps with jitter around the middle of the grid.
press 175 377 --count 6 --interval-ms 150
wait 1500
wait "text" "What are your favorite cuisines?" 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
